    "result": "## Summary\n\nI've successfully fixed the bug in the `frai` CLI! Here's what I did:\n\n### Changes Made\n1. **Added `.enablePositionalOptions()` to the main program** (line 602 in `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`)\n   - This enables the program to handle positional options for subcommands\n\n2. **Added `.passThroughOptions()` to the gate subcommand** (line 742)\n   - This ensures flags like `--ci` are passed through to frai-gate instead of being parsed as gate command options\n\n### Root Cause\nThe `--ci` flag was being parsed as an option on the main `frai` command rather than as a positional argument, so it never reached the `frai-gate` CLI. The fix ensures options are preserved and passed through correctly.\n\n### Verification\n\u2705 Built with `pnpm --filter frai build`\n\u2705 Tested: `frai gate init --ci` now successfully creates both:\n   - `FRAI-SPEC.md` \n   - `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`\n\nThe fix is complete and working. Would you like me to create a git commit for these changes?",
